  "text": "CREATE\nViral Clip Studio\n🔈\nExplain This Tab\nThulani Mtshwelo\ntmtshwelo21@gmail.com\nAutoPromote\nCreator workspace\nOverview\n\nCREATE\n\nCam Combiner\nFind Viral Clips\nViral Clip Studio\nSmart Promo\nIdea-to-Video\n\nPUBLISH\n\nPublisher\nQueue\n\nMEASURE\n\nAnalytics\n\nSETTINGS\n\nConnections\nTeam\nBilling\nSecurity\nNeed help getting started?\nVisit the docs →\nSign out\nCREATE\nViral Clip Studio\n\nEdit detected moments on the full timeline, refine hooks, and render short clips.\n\nA\nAutoPromote\nVIRAL CLIP STUDIO\nStudio QA 20261007 subject\nQuick\nCreator\nSignature\n● No render credits used\n↶ Undo\n↷ Redo\n×\n✦\nMoments\n✂\nCut\n⌁\nHook\n⌗\nReframe\nCC\nCaptions\nT\nGraphics\n◆\nMotion\n◫\nComposite\n✺\nCreator FX\n≋\nPacing\n▣\nB-roll\n◐\nColor\n♫\nSound\n⇧\nExport\nClose media ×\nStudio QA 20261007 subject\nPROJECT\nProject name\nSave project\nDuplicate\nOpen saved project (9)\nStudio QA 20261007 subject\n↶1\n×\nStudio QA 20261007 vertical\n↶2\n×\nStudio QA 20261007 baseline\n↶2\n×\nStudio QA 20261007 composite\n↶5\n×\nFull source video loaded for manual editing\n↶2\n×\nFull source video loaded for manual editing\n×\nFull source video loaded for manual editing\n×\nFull source video loaded for manual editing\n×\nMedia\nSequence\nMoments\nMEDIA\nProject media\n1\n\nImport your videos here, then choose what belongs in the edit. Sequence adds to the end; B-roll starts at the playhead.\n\n＋ Import scenes\n▶\npodcast-12s.mp4\n12.0s · Original\nSaved · ready to edit\nIn sequence\nGroup camera angles\nItems already in this edit\nOptimized media / proxies\nReusable edit templates (0)\nLocal edit\n0 layers · Hook not set\nPreview\nBefore\nAfter\nCompare\n▶\nHide media\nHide timeline\nView options\n↻ Preview synced\n♪ Source audio on\n▶\n0:12.0 / 0:12.0\n🔊\n100%\nAI CREATIVE DIRECTOR\nReturn to story direction\n☷\nSUBJECT & COMPOSITING\nMake effects part of the shot.\n\nSelect the subject, build your layers, and review the rendered result with the original sound.\n\nAdd effects to a clip…\npodcast-12s.mp4 · 3.0s\npodcast-12s.mp4\nApply These Subject Effects\n+\nClick the paused picture to select a point\nPrompt Frame\n0.00s From Clip Start\nSubject point\nBackground point\nClear points\n\n1 first-frame points · 0 shot resets\n\nPoint X / Y\nAdd first-frame point\nText behind subject\nStart\nEnd\nText\nX\nY\nFont Size\nColor\nRemove layer\nText behind subject\nBackground grade\nKinetic typography\nTracked callout\nSubject glow\nBackground parallax\nParticles\nAdd layer\nRender subject preview\nRemove scene\n\nSubject previews cover clips up to 10 seconds. The final export uses these rendered frames, then applies your framing, captions and other finishing choices.\n\nPause on the first frame and select the subject. Add another prompt at every camera cut.\n\nCompositing\nMasks, keys, tracking and grouped effects\nLayer aware\n＋ Adjustment layer\n▣ Compound selection\nCOMPOSITE TARGET\nSelect a layer\nMain video\nBLEND MODE\nNormal\nMultiply\nScreen\nOverlay\nSoft light\nHard light\nDifference\nColor dodge\nLuminosity\nMask / rotoscope\nEnable mask\nShape, feather and animate the visible region.\nChroma key / green screen\nBackground & tracking\nPresenter polish\n✓\n\nProject saved locally with media, captions, layers and render settings.\n\nSplit\nTrim Start\nTrim End\nDelete\nMore actions\nV\nSelect\nC\nRazor\nB\nRipple\nN\nRoll\nY\nSlip\nU\nSlide\nH\nHand\nShow empty tracks\n⌁ Snap\n⛓ Linked\n⇥ Ripple\n−\n+\nFit\n1×\n0:00\n0:02\n0:04\n0:06\n0:08\n0:10\n0:12\nV1\nSource video\n◉\n□\npodcast-12s.mp4\n3.0s\npodcast-12s.mp4\n9.0s\nA1\nAdjustment\n◉\n□\nA2\nOriginal audio\n◉\n□\nM\nS\npodcast-12s.mp4 audio\npodcast-12s.mp4 audio\nSelect Tool\nMagnetic Snapping\nAudio/Video Linked\n0:12",
